Palette provenance
------------------

The palette data is based on the Modus themes designed by Protesilaos Stavrou
and published under CC0-1.0 at:
https://protesilaos.com/emacs/modus-themes-colors

The current palette snapshot was extracted from Modus Themes 5.3.0 at upstream commit
52d4665bc5d5505e9761fe6068ab5426ad70a52a. Palette data is extracted without
upstream presets. Port-specific palette choices are expressed directly in each
tool template.

The GPL-licensed upstream implementation is fetched into a temporary directory
only while synchronizing palettes and is not distributed in this repository.

This is an independent porting project and is not affiliated with or endorsed
by the Free Software Foundation, GNU, or Protesilaos Stavrou.
